Include <stdint.h> in dumb.h.

dumb.h uses int64_t through DUMB_OFF_T_CUSTOM but relies on <stdlib.h> to
provide the <stdint.h> types, as glibc does. The PS5 SDK's stdlib.h does not.

Upstream: harmless portability fix, suitable for xbmc/audiodecoder.dumb.

--- a/lib/dumb/include/dumb.h
+++ b/lib/dumb/include/dumb.h
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@
 
 #include <stdlib.h>
 #include <stdio.h>
+#include <stdint.h>
 
 #ifdef _DEBUG
 #ifdef _MSC_VER
